WEBVTT

00:06.810 --> 00:08.400
Okikura here.

00:08.630 --> 00:12.590
Hi, it's Fukami, from school.

00:12.590 --> 00:14.330
Oh, it's me.

00:14.810 --> 00:16.780
Oh, Okikura-kun, hey,

00:17.800 --> 00:20.660
I want to see the future.

00:21.290 --> 00:23.660
<b><i>I want to see the future, too.</i></b>

01:56.880 --> 01:58.220
<b>That thing just now—</b>

01:58.260 --> 02:02.470
<b>Episode 3
"Utility Tank"</b>

01:58.890 --> 02:00.970
<b>Yeah, is that now?</b>

02:01.290 --> 02:03.100
<b>Yeah, now.</b>

02:03.350 --> 02:05.140
<b>Let's meet up to talk.</b>

02:05.790 --> 02:06.980
<b>I'll go to your place.</b>

02:07.390 --> 02:08.290
<b>Eh?</b>

02:08.290 --> 02:10.440
<i>It'll get late if we meet now.</i>

02:10.440 --> 02:14.210
<b>No, don't worry about it. I'll be fine.</b>

02:14.210 --> 02:15.940
<i>I'm going to finish up some things first.</i>

02:32.250 --> 02:34.040
<b>I have a really important guest—</b>

02:37.060 --> 02:40.050
<b>Piece! Yeah, piece—that I'm going to work on.</b>

02:40.050 --> 02:42.040
<b>So don't come into the workshop.</b>

02:43.030 --> 02:46.090
<b>Sure, but be done by dinner.</b>

02:46.090 --> 02:47.090
<b>I will.</b>

02:47.390 --> 02:49.500
<b>You're a hard worker, Touko.</b>

03:03.010 --> 03:05.830
<i>It wasn't Yana-chan that Yuki-kun liked...</i>

03:05.830 --> 03:08.450
<i>And Okikura-kun is coming over...</i>

03:14.880 --> 03:15.960
<i>Okay.</i>

03:30.850 --> 03:33.830
<i>Yuki-kun and Yana-chan are
 such precious friends to me.</i>

03:34.130 --> 03:36.610
<i>They always have been, 
and they always will be.</i>

03:37.180 --> 03:40.100
<i>But even if my feelings don't change,</i>

03:40.100 --> 03:42.990
<i>our friendships might.</i>

04:13.450 --> 04:15.880
<i>Yana-chan's crying.</i>

04:27.830 --> 04:33.290
<b>Try glassware
single-flower cups</b>

04:40.860 --> 04:42.420
<b>I'm going to make Yana-chan cry.</b>

04:43.330 --> 04:44.430
<b>You saw the future?</b>

04:44.880 --> 04:45.580
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:48.890 --> 04:49.680
<b>Makes sense.</b>

04:50.000 --> 04:50.810
<b>Hm?</b>

04:55.630 --> 04:59.630
<b>This is why glass is your medium.</b>

05:00.190 --> 05:01.330
<b>Maybe.</b>

05:03.750 --> 05:04.900
<b>A guest?</b>

05:06.400 --> 05:07.090
<b>Good evening.</b>

05:07.090 --> 05:08.240
<b>We're busy.</b>

05:08.240 --> 05:10.460
<b>Thanks for taking care of my sister.</b>

05:10.460 --> 05:11.550
<b>I'll bring tea—</b>

05:10.920 --> 05:13.410
<b>It's fine, Okikura-kun was just about to leave.</b>

05:14.740 --> 05:17.500
<b>D-Don't tell Mom and Dad, okay?</b>

05:21.840 --> 05:23.720
<b>We're having pork cutlets tonight.</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:24.840
<b>See you.</b>

05:28.090 --> 05:31.450
<b>Sorry you came only to 
have me kick you out.</b>

05:31.750 --> 05:33.470
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

05:34.040 --> 05:37.750
<b>I wanted to see Yana-chan 
and Yuki-kun's future.</b>

05:38.390 --> 05:40.480
<b>Did Yukinari Imi confess 
to you or something?</b>

05:40.700 --> 05:42.940
<b>H-How did you—</b>

05:46.290 --> 05:48.380
<b>Yana-chan realized there was</b>

05:48.380 --> 05:50.570
<b>someone Yuki-kun liked,</b>

05:50.570 --> 05:52.630
<b>so she came to talk to me.</b>

05:53.140 --> 05:56.510
<b>You must have been the only 
one who hadn't noticed.</b>

05:58.430 --> 06:01.760
<b>What would you have done, 
having seen their future?</b>

06:02.060 --> 06:05.550
<b>I wanted to think of a way to make 
sure we wouldn't get torn apart.</b>

06:06.240 --> 06:07.870
<b>I don't know if that can be granted,</b>

06:08.170 --> 06:11.240
<b>but I like that you put 
effort into everything.</b>

06:11.920 --> 06:13.920
<b>I'll be fine from here. Thanks.</b>

06:16.530 --> 06:18.620
<b>We're going to the mountain tomorrow.</b>

06:18.620 --> 06:19.810
<b>Would you like to come, too?</b>

06:22.630 --> 06:23.320
<b>Why?</b>

06:24.500 --> 06:27.470
<b>I was thinking maybe you haven't made</b>

06:27.470 --> 06:29.990
<b>many new friends here yet.</b>

06:30.660 --> 06:33.290
<b>I make a point to go hiking by myself.</b>

06:33.880 --> 06:35.070
<b>See you soon.</b>

06:39.160 --> 06:41.940
<i>I was the only one who didn't notice.</i>

06:42.320 --> 06:43.960
<i>No way.</i>

07:08.750 --> 07:10.940
<b>There's still time.</b>

07:09.110 --> 07:10.160
<b>Did you have trouble sleeping?</b>

07:10.160 --> 07:11.610
<b>A bit.</b>

07:10.940 --> 07:13.810
<b>But I need another way...</b>

07:11.610 --> 07:13.810
<b>That doesn't make any sense.</b>

07:13.810 --> 07:17.240
<b>I'm telling you, it's important for girls.</b>

07:17.620 --> 07:21.060
<b>Why do you need to bring 
a dryer on a hiking trip?</b>

07:21.060 --> 07:23.420
<b>What if my hair gets messed up?</b>

07:23.420 --> 07:25.570
<b>Where are we even going 
to find wall sockets?</b>

07:25.570 --> 07:28.260
<b>Rechargeable, duh.</b>

07:30.990 --> 07:31.700
<b>Morning.</b>

07:31.700 --> 07:32.540
<b>Morning.</b>

07:32.040 --> 07:32.790
<b>Morning.</b>

07:32.790 --> 07:34.090
<b>We were waiting for you.</b>

07:36.000 --> 07:37.060
<b>Morning.</b>

07:37.300 --> 07:38.810
<b>All right, let's do this.</b>

07:43.700 --> 07:45.670
<b>I'm here.</b>

07:45.670 --> 07:47.570
<b>You're late, Nee-chan.</b>

07:48.770 --> 07:50.590
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:51.660 --> 07:54.620
<b>I took the wrong road. Tee hee.</b>

07:57.220 --> 08:00.760
<b>You're really, really going to be okay?</b>

08:00.760 --> 08:02.720
<b>It'll be fine.</b>

08:02.720 --> 08:05.000
<b>Trust me. I care about you.</b>

08:06.170 --> 08:08.480
<b>Call me right away if you get worried.</b>

08:06.950 --> 08:08.970
<b>See you at the meet-up spot!</b>

08:12.110 --> 08:13.450
<b>Back up, everyone!</b>

08:25.880 --> 08:29.240
<b>I've seen you a few times before, Sacchan.</b>

08:30.150 --> 08:31.840
<b>Can I call you "Sacchan"?</b>

08:32.200 --> 08:32.820
<b>Yes.</b>

08:33.270 --> 08:35.840
<b>Everyone around here goes</b>

08:35.840 --> 08:38.440
<b>to the central hospital, right?</b>

08:38.440 --> 08:39.470
<b>Shoot.</b>

08:39.470 --> 08:41.870
<b>Oh, that's a cute pendant.</b>

08:41.870 --> 08:43.120
<b>Where did you buy it?</b>

08:44.290 --> 08:45.980
<b>It was a gift.</b>

08:47.020 --> 08:48.580
<b>Good taste.</b>

08:48.580 --> 08:50.230
<b>From who, your boyfriend?</b>

08:50.230 --> 08:52.970
<b>No, but it's someone I love.</b>

08:53.270 --> 08:55.470
<b>Oh man, he's good!</b>

08:57.050 --> 08:58.350
<b>Whoops.</b>

09:01.070 --> 09:02.270
<b>So yeah,</b>

09:02.640 --> 09:05.360
<b>my kid brother's out-of-touch 
when it comes to girls,</b>

09:05.360 --> 09:08.720
<b>and he worries about silly 
things like his height,</b>

09:09.020 --> 09:10.710
<b>but he's a good guy at heart.</b>

09:11.270 --> 09:12.260
<b>Right...</b>

09:12.260 --> 09:14.110
<b>Be good to him, yeah?</b>

09:28.200 --> 09:29.260
<b>Thanks.</b>

09:29.710 --> 09:33.130
<b>Were you too pumped about today to sleep?</b>

09:34.370 --> 09:36.800
<b>Okikura-kun came over yesterday.</b>

09:36.800 --> 09:39.370
<b>Okikura-kun is that new student, right?</b>

09:39.670 --> 09:42.390
<b>He seemed like he'd like mountains. 
Maybe we should have invited him.</b>

09:43.360 --> 09:47.060
<b>I did, but he said he likes hiking alone.</b>

09:47.480 --> 09:49.260
<b>A lone wolf, huh?</b>

09:49.690 --> 09:52.250
<b>I like hiking with my friends.</b>

09:52.250 --> 09:55.000
<b>Let's go, another half-hour!</b>

10:06.420 --> 10:08.720
<b>Over here!</b>

10:13.240 --> 10:15.410
<b>Over here!</b>

10:21.940 --> 10:22.980
<b>How are you feeling?</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:26.180
<b>Thanks, it was fun in the car.</b>

10:26.600 --> 10:28.050
<b>It was fun?</b>

10:28.050 --> 10:29.700
<b>I've never been on one,</b>

10:29.700 --> 10:32.480
<b>but I imagine it's what roller coasters are like.</b>

10:32.480 --> 10:33.690
<b>Roller...</b>

10:34.320 --> 10:37.320
<b>Okay, I'll come pick you up when it's time.</b>

10:37.800 --> 10:38.950
<b>Yeah, thanks.</b>

10:38.950 --> 10:40.350
<b>You be careful, too—</b>

10:43.970 --> 10:45.910
<b>She's like the wind.</b>

10:46.860 --> 10:49.200
<b>Living with her, she's more like a typhoon.</b>

10:58.800 --> 11:00.260
<b>We're here!</b>

11:00.800 --> 11:03.150
<b>Look, mountains!</b>

11:04.350 --> 11:05.840
<b>And the ocean!</b>

11:10.320 --> 11:12.790
<b>We just came up a mountain, too, you know.</b>

11:21.320 --> 11:22.070
<b>What?</b>

11:22.620 --> 11:24.590
<b>It feels awesome.</b>

11:26.050 --> 11:28.450
<b>There's still snow over there.</b>

11:28.760 --> 11:30.870
<b>Isn't that Hinode Mountain?</b>

11:35.650 --> 11:37.380
<b>How can I help?</b>

11:37.380 --> 11:39.860
<b>Can you get some water in here?</b>

11:39.860 --> 11:40.760
<b>Roger!</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:43.950
<b>Where can we go for water, again?</b>

11:43.950 --> 11:45.540
<b>I'll go with you.</b>

11:45.540 --> 11:46.900
<b>You shouldn't, Sachi.</b>

11:46.900 --> 11:50.200
<b>Yeah. You're probably the weakest one here.</b>

11:50.600 --> 11:51.540
<b>I'll go.</b>

11:52.430 --> 11:53.710
<b>Then I'll go, too.</b>

11:53.710 --> 11:56.620
<b>You're in charge of the tents, Yukinari.</b>

11:57.320 --> 11:58.400
<b>I am?</b>

11:58.400 --> 11:59.500
<b>Let's go, Yana-chan.</b>

12:09.040 --> 12:11.720
<b>Imagine if we look all over,</b>

12:11.720 --> 12:14.580
<b>and it turns out there's water right there.</b>

12:22.990 --> 12:24.340
<b>Hey, Yana-chan.</b>

12:23.630 --> 12:25.770
<b>There's something I wanted 
to ask you, Touko.</b>

12:26.360 --> 12:27.750
<b>Oh hey, a creek.</b>

12:38.910 --> 12:40.090
<b>It's so pretty.</b>

12:44.830 --> 12:45.740
<b>Are you going to go out with Yuki?</b>

12:46.010 --> 12:46.800
<b>What?</b>

12:48.030 --> 12:49.670
<b>What are you doing?</b>

12:49.670 --> 12:50.620
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:52.710 --> 12:53.650
<b>Hey...</b>

13:05.140 --> 13:08.400
<b>I set up sheets. You can sit down and read.</b>

13:14.430 --> 13:15.790
<b>Good luck, dude.</b>

13:17.000 --> 13:17.770
<b>Where are you going?</b>

13:19.300 --> 13:20.750
<b>I'm going to find those two.</b>

13:20.750 --> 13:22.230
<b>Yeah, they're late.</b>

13:23.000 --> 13:25.350
<b>Maybe they couldn't figure 
out where to get water.</b>

13:25.650 --> 13:28.080
<b>There's a tap just over there.</b>

13:32.060 --> 13:34.600
<b>He's pretty thoughtful, too.</b>

13:37.060 --> 13:38.370
<b>Do you like yakisoba?</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:40.590
<b>With a lot of pickled red ginger.</b>

13:41.500 --> 13:42.590
<b>Got it.</b>

13:44.670 --> 13:46.180
<b>We should be okay here.</b>

13:50.050 --> 13:51.430
<b>You're so bold.</b>

13:52.080 --> 13:54.820
<b>Whose fault is that?</b>

13:56.380 --> 13:57.730
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:07.820
<b>Well, I just have bad timing.</b>

14:11.420 --> 14:12.460
<b>Yana-chan.</b>

14:16.820 --> 14:19.300
<b>Touko, what did you think about Yuki?</b>

14:20.160 --> 14:21.460
<b>Honestly,</b>

14:22.000 --> 14:23.590
<b>I'm surprised. I don't know.</b>

14:25.680 --> 14:26.640
<b>Seems like it.</b>

14:26.940 --> 14:29.600
<b>You wouldn't normally say "thanks" 
after being confessed to.</b>

14:29.600 --> 14:31.550
<b>I said that?</b>

14:31.550 --> 14:33.220
<b>Wait, how did you know?</b>

14:33.220 --> 14:34.230
<b>I saw,</b>

14:34.560 --> 14:35.520
<b>by accident.</b>

14:38.850 --> 14:41.050
<b>Touko, are you going to go out with him?</b>

14:45.060 --> 14:46.150
<b>No.</b>

14:46.990 --> 14:48.620
<b>Yuki-kun's really cool</b>

14:48.620 --> 14:51.970
<b>but my romance sensor didn't go off.</b>

14:53.220 --> 14:54.030
<b>Your what?</b>

14:54.750 --> 14:56.980
<b>I doubt you have such a thing installed.</b>

14:56.980 --> 14:59.040
<b>Too bad I can't show you.</b>

15:04.950 --> 15:07.330
<b>You're not going to, huh?</b>

15:07.800 --> 15:10.310
<b>You'd be a bit more obvious if</b>

15:10.740 --> 15:12.470
<b>you liked him, I guess.</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:17.570
<b>Besides, I decided to support you.</b>

15:18.310 --> 15:19.150
<b>I</b>

15:19.870 --> 15:20.900
<b>won't give up.</b>

15:21.350 --> 15:23.360
<b>No service</b>

15:23.820 --> 15:26.860
<b>You couldn't get lost here 
even if you tried, but...</b>

15:42.020 --> 15:43.330
<b>What the hell are you doing?</b>

15:43.820 --> 15:47.650
<b>Why are you the one screaming?</b>

15:47.650 --> 15:49.340
<b>Get lost!</b>

15:49.340 --> 15:51.550
<b>And damn yourself to an 
eternity of fetching water!</b>

16:02.790 --> 16:04.860
<b>You're so beautiful,</b>

16:04.860 --> 16:08.540
<b>the way you're so invested in reading.</b>

16:08.910 --> 16:10.420
<b>You're like</b>

16:10.420 --> 16:13.700
<b>a doll to me.</b>

16:14.310 --> 16:16.740
<b>Pretty. A poem or something?</b>

16:18.150 --> 16:19.320
<b>No.</b>

16:19.820 --> 16:21.990
<b>Where're the noodles?</b>

16:21.990 --> 16:22.890
<b>Here.</b>

16:23.710 --> 16:24.710
<b>Thanks.</b>

16:27.000 --> 16:28.470
<b>Hot!</b>

16:28.470 --> 16:29.450
<b>Are you okay?</b>

16:29.450 --> 16:30.930
<b>I'm fine.</b>

16:31.250 --> 16:32.270
<b>Water.</b>

16:32.270 --> 16:34.270
<b>I'm back. What's the water for?</b>

16:34.570 --> 16:35.850
<b>For Hiro-kun.</b>

16:37.560 --> 16:39.430
<b>Do I dump it on his head?</b>

16:39.430 --> 16:41.230
<b>How about I dump it on <i>your head?</i></b>

16:41.460 --> 16:43.390
<b>Seriously, that freaked me out.</b>

16:44.940 --> 16:46.690
<b>Time to eat!</b>

16:49.830 --> 16:50.850
<b>It's good.</b>

16:51.150 --> 16:53.600
<b>Right? Dig in!</b>

16:52.580 --> 16:54.140
<b>A token of our friendship.</b>

16:54.140 --> 16:56.130
<b>I'll have it, then.</b>

16:56.130 --> 16:56.660
<b>Good.</b>

17:00.050 --> 17:01.070
<b>Token.</b>

17:05.690 --> 17:06.630
<b>That sounds good.</b>

17:07.120 --> 17:09.470
<b>I'll have some if it gets 
on the menu. Good luck.</b>

17:09.470 --> 17:10.230
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:10.230 --> 17:11.640
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

17:26.580 --> 17:29.990
<b>You were like a doll to me.</b>

17:29.990 --> 17:31.750
<b>But I realized...</b>

17:36.110 --> 17:37.120
<b>Sacchan.</b>

17:42.030 --> 17:43.500
<b>How's your hand?</b>

17:44.030 --> 17:47.420
<b>Yeah, it's not burnt or anything.</b>

17:55.620 --> 17:56.460
<b>Here.</b>

17:59.060 --> 18:01.010
<b>For taking care of me.</b>

18:01.250 --> 18:04.220
<b>Not at all, thanks to you, t—</b>

18:06.150 --> 18:07.480
<b>You can read it now, if you want.</b>

18:08.740 --> 18:10.710
<b>Sacchan, I,</b>

18:11.500 --> 18:12.590
<b>well—</b>

18:13.970 --> 18:15.810
<b>I—Sachi!</b>

18:16.290 --> 18:17.490
<b>I like your name.</b>

18:51.860 --> 18:53.480
<b>There's something I need to tell you.</b>

18:53.840 --> 18:57.780
<b>I think there's someone 
that's more suited for you.</b>

18:58.780 --> 19:00.280
<b>Is there someone you like?</b>

19:01.010 --> 19:02.040
<b>No.</b>

19:02.590 --> 19:04.120
<b>Then—</b>

19:04.120 --> 19:05.050
<b>I can't.</b>

19:07.340 --> 19:08.290
<b>Why?</b>

19:08.940 --> 19:11.210
<b>Because you're a precious friend.</b>

19:13.470 --> 19:14.510
<b>I see.</b>

19:31.340 --> 19:32.770
<b>Sorry to be such a bother.</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:34.060
<b>No problem.</b>

19:34.060 --> 19:35.620
<b>Wait inside.</b>

19:35.620 --> 19:36.360
<b>Okay.</b>

19:36.660 --> 19:39.540
<b>Oh yeah, I saw a boar on my way here.</b>

19:40.170 --> 19:42.320
<b>It looked pretty vicious, 
so if you run into one,</b>

19:42.320 --> 19:44.480
<b>don't pretend to be asleep.</b>

19:44.480 --> 19:46.480
<b>Isn't that for bears?</b>

19:44.980 --> 19:46.480
<b>Sorry.</b>

19:46.770 --> 19:48.480
<b>Oh, really?</b>

19:48.580 --> 19:50.120
<b>Sorry I didn't help.</b>

19:50.610 --> 19:53.580
<b>It didn't take long to pack up, no worries.</b>

19:54.520 --> 19:56.420
<b>We're done, Nee-chan.</b>

19:56.820 --> 19:59.210
<b>You're getting a ride home, right?</b>

19:59.210 --> 20:00.000
<b>Yes.</b>

20:00.000 --> 20:01.470
<b>Café next time, then, maybe?</b>

20:01.950 --> 20:04.090
<b>Thanks for everything today, Touko-chan.</b>

20:12.900 --> 20:14.140
<b>We're heading out.</b>

20:14.140 --> 20:16.030
<b>Be careful, Nee-chan.</b>

20:16.030 --> 20:16.940
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

20:17.900 --> 20:19.860
<b>Sacchan, are you doing okay?</b>

20:22.400 --> 20:25.540
<b>Okay, let's go, before we run into boars.</b>

20:25.540 --> 20:28.720
<b>Did you know there are more 
accidents going down mountains</b>

20:28.240 --> 20:29.920
<b>Okay, whatever, let's go.</b>

20:28.720 --> 20:29.920
<b>than going up?</b>

20:29.920 --> 20:31.990
<b>Let's go, Touko.</b>

20:32.850 --> 20:34.880
<b>Okay, thanks.</b>

20:36.090 --> 20:38.700
<b>I'll lead the way.</b>

20:38.700 --> 20:40.050
<b>Don't get lost.</b>

20:40.050 --> 20:40.980
<b>Roger.</b>

20:40.980 --> 20:41.970
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

20:56.980 --> 21:01.440
<b>Hinode 
Bridge</b>

21:01.440 --> 21:03.200
<b>Sacchan
Text Message</b>

21:08.880 --> 21:09.790
<i>To Touko-chan,</i>

21:10.420 --> 21:12.230
<i>Thanks for everything today.</i>

21:12.230 --> 21:13.760
<i>I'll contact you soon.</i>

21:13.760 --> 21:14.680
<b>Welcome home.</b>

21:14.680 --> 21:15.660
<b>I'm home.</b>

21:20.930 --> 21:22.490
<b>Hey, Hina-chan,</b>

21:23.050 --> 21:26.060
<b>what would you do if your best friend 
got confessed to by someone you like?</b>

21:26.360 --> 21:27.650
<b>You got confessed to?</b>

21:31.820 --> 21:33.850
<b>Jeez, stop it.</b>

21:33.850 --> 21:34.440
<b>Well?</b>

21:34.820 --> 21:36.630
<b>What could I do?</b>

21:36.930 --> 21:39.540
<b>It'd depend on whether I liked 
the person back or not.</b>

21:39.840 --> 21:41.940
<b>What else could I say?</b>

21:42.750 --> 21:44.190
<b>That's my Hina-chan.</b>

21:46.040 --> 21:47.530
<b>Stop it!</b>

21:49.340 --> 21:51.600
<b>So that guy from the other day—</b>

21:51.600 --> 21:53.850
<b>did he go hiking with you?</b>

21:54.200 --> 21:56.130
<b>No, he didn't!</b>

23:28.900 --> 23:30.470
<b>Kakeru is a weird name.</b>

23:30.470 --> 23:32.360
<b>Yanagi—nice name.</b>

23:32.360 --> 23:33.760
<b>Kind of awesome, isn't it?</b>

23:33.760 --> 23:34.880
<b>Really?</b>

23:34.880 --> 23:36.350
<b>Do you like him?</b>

23:35.060 --> 23:38.140
<b>Episode 4:
"Steep Road"</b>

23:36.350 --> 23:38.140
<b>You're showing off a bit, aren't you?</b>
